{
  "_comment": "Copy this file to app/src/main/res/raw/config.json (gitignored). Debug -> Config can override every field at runtime; overrides apply after an app restart.",
  "OTLP_ENDPOINT": "",
  "_OTLP_ENDPOINT_comment": "OTLP/HTTP base URL without /v1/*. Empty disables export. For Frontend Observability use your Faro collector's https://faro-collector-<region>.grafana.net/otlp/<appKey> and leave OTLP_INSTANCE_ID and OTLP_API_KEY empty; native OTLP ingest must be enabled on the stack. Legacy: the OTLP gateway https://otlp-gateway-<regionSlug>.grafana.net/otlp with both credentials set keeps data as raw OTel in Tempo/Loki, not visible in Frontend Observability. See ../docs/CONNECT_GRAFANA_CLOUD.md.",
  "OTLP_INSTANCE_ID": "",
  "_OTLP_INSTANCE_ID_comment": "Numeric OTLP gateway instance ID. Legacy gateway only; leave empty for Faro.",
  "OTLP_API_KEY": "",
  "_OTLP_API_KEY_comment": "Grafana Cloud access token (glc_...), combined with the instance ID into Authorization: Basic. Legacy gateway only; leave empty for Faro.",
  "BASE_URL": "",
  "_BASE_URL_comment": "Leave empty on emulators (uses http://10.0.2.2:3333). On a device (API 24+), run adb reverse tcp:3333 tcp:3333 and use http://127.0.0.1:3333, or use an HTTPS backend. HTTP to a LAN IP is blocked; API 23 needs HTTPS."
}
